  "dataset": "scifact",
  "protocol": "Train (809) selects sparse-off margin, list-conditioned scorer, and whether head/title rerank help. Frozen on test (300). Dense is always retrieved; BM42 is skipped when the semantic router is confidently dense.",
  "stages": {
    "router_sparse_gate": "combined prototype+heuristic route; skip sparse iff route=dense and score gap \u2265 tau. Dense search always on (BM42-only is worse on SciFact).",
